f the Ikura sisters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A girl who exudes a cool and mysterious aura."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She speaks little and in a detached manner, often making her stand out from those around her. Usually it's very difficult to understand what she's thinking, however, once the topic shifts to something she \"likes\"…?"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Although her younger sister seems more responsible, she surprisingly has a family-oriented and domestic side."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Despite her pure appearance, she harbors an intense sex drive. She is a closet pervert whose lewd thoughts are shown clearly on her face."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She made her cosplay debut after being encouraged by her younger sister. Through role-playing with the protagonist, she begins to enjoy not just wearing the costumes but fully embodying the characters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Whether it’s cosplay, role-playing, or her work, she strives relentlessly to reach new heights."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Right... Let’s do more lewd role-playing...\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c148624"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"郁良姉妹の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールでミステリアスな雰囲気漂う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で淡々と話すため、周囲から浮いてしまうこともしばしば。普段は何を考えているのか分からないが、ひとたび「好きなもの」の話題になると……？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹のほうがしっかりしているように見えて、意外に家族想いで家庭的な一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚な見た目とは裏腹に性欲はとても強く、エッチなことは全て表情に出てしまうむっつりドスケベである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹に誘われてコスプレデビューを果たす。主人公とのロールプレイを通じて衣装だけでなく内面までなりきるのが楽しくなっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"コスプレも、ロールプレイも、お仕事も“高み”を目指して邁進していく。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27346","sourceWorkId":"37802","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「うん……もっとエッチなロールプレイ……しよ」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"郁良姉妹の姉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"クールでミステリアスな雰囲気漂う女の子。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"無口で淡々と話すため、周囲から浮いてしまうこともしばしば。普段は何を考えているのか分からないが、ひとたび「好きなもの」の話題になると……？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹のほうがしっかりしているように見えて、意外に家族想いで家庭的な一面も。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"清楚な見た目とは裏腹に性欲はとても強く、エッチなことは全て表情に出てしまうむっつりドスケベである。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹に誘われてコスプレデビューを果たす。主人公とのロールプレイを通じて衣装だけでなく内面までなりきるのが楽しくなっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"コスプレも、ロールプレイも、お仕事も“高み”を目指して邁進していく。"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"170322"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/8a/8ab79bcb1b3dad299d467ef7facf011dbd13a73a83ef29bce00abe24b48351b2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/6c/6c374fcb5cf020debce1383d94e8bdf3abe65555d5aa916f6f0e16f1aec6a643.webp","width":135,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"間宮菜南子","creatorId":"vndb:s999","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s999","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s999","name":"間宮 菜南子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:534726:170322:15995:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c148625","characterName":"郁良 凛音","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"170323","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"534726"}],"egsCharacterIds":["27347"],"vndbCharacterId":"c148625"},"originalCharacterName":"郁良 凛音","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The Younger of the Ikura Sisters."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s always cheerful and sociable, tending to go along with those around her, and the only people she can truly be herself with are her family. The truth is, she’s somewhat shy and has a clingy personality."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She has no romantic experience, and her sexual knowledge is only from hearsay, making her still quite innocent. However, surprisingly, her sex drive is strong, and the desires she has kept accumulated secretly are on the verge of exploding..."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"She’s always been interested in cosplay and convinced her older sister to debut in cosplay with her. Since her older sister is a bit clumsy, she takes on the role of crafting their costumes."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Actually, she admires figure sculptors, and the protagonist is someone she looks up to."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"After meeting the protagonist, she’s been growing day by day, honing her skills in cosplay, role-playing, and her own personal obsessions!"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"\"Um... we have to... undress, don't we...?\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c148625"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"郁良姉妹の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも元気で社交的だが、周りに合わせてしまうフシもあり、本当の自分でいられる相手は家族だけだった。実際には恥ずかしがり屋で甘えん坊気質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛経験はなく、性知識も聞きかじったものばかりなのでまだまだ初心。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし意外にも性欲は強く、内側に秘めてきた欲求は今にも爆発寸前……？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々コスプレには興味があり、姉を誘ってコスプレデビュー。不器用な姉に代わって衣装作りもこなす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実はフィギュア造形師に憧れをいだいており、主人公は憧れの存在だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな主人公と出会い、切磋琢磨しながらコスプレも、ロールプレイも、こだわりも日々成長中！"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"27347","sourceWorkId":"37802","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"「うん……逆に、隅々まで触って確かめて欲しいかも」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"郁良姉妹の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも元気で社交的だが、周りに合わせてしまうフシもあり、本当の自分でいられる相手は家族だけだった。実際には恥ずかしがり屋で甘えん坊気質。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"恋愛経験はなく、性知識も聞きかじったものばかりなのでまだまだ初心。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"しかし意外にも性欲は強く、内側に秘めてきた欲求は今にも爆発寸前……？"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"元々コスプレには興味があり、姉を誘ってコスプレデビュー。不器用な姉に代わって衣装作りもこなす。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実はフィギュア造形師に憧れをいだいており、主人公は憧れの存在だった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"そんな主人公と出会い、切磋琢磨しながらコスプレも、ロールプレイも、こだわりも日々成長中！"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"170323"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/af/af3d44fc4255224dbb3b3d749b2c798964fbb6523fe4bd84d559c4fef32d0d5a.